; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI031"],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Present actual recipient, target, arguments, data disclosure, and consequences for high-impact approval.","Invalidate approval if arguments or target change; test races, delayed retries, and approval reuse."],"finding_ids":["592fbfc9b7dab062dc97906c"],"id":"AGT-02","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENT-CS"],"sources":["https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/AI_Agent_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html"],"status":"findings_detected","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Bind approval to the action executed","validation":"dynamic"},{"alignment_source_ids":[],"assurance":"Partial static coverage only; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI032"],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Track origin and trust level for web pages, documents, messages, OCR, tool results, and repository instructions.","Test direct and indirect goal hijacking; formatting delimiters and prompt warnings alone are not access controls."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-03","source_ids":["OWASP-LLM2026"],"sources":["https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-genai-llm-top-10-2026/"],"status":"no_pattern_detected","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Separate untrusted content from authoritative instructions","validation":"hybrid"},{"alignment_source_ids":["CSA-MAESTRO","CIS-AGENTS-2026"],"assurance":"Not established by this static scan","automated_rule_ids":[],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Enforce document and memory ACLs at retrieval and update time, including vector search metadata filters.","Test poisoned memory persistence, cross-tenant retrieval, provenance loss, deletion, and stale privileged context."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-04","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENTIC"],"sources":["https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-for-2026/"],"status":"review_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Protect retrieval and 